    {"say": "Underneath, a laser head shines a thin blue light at the disc. Blue light has a very short wave, so it can read really tiny bumps.",
     "do": [{"reveal": ["laser"]}, {"label": ["laser"]}, {"highlight": ["laser"]}, {"zoom": "laser"}]},
    {"say": "The light bounces back differently from a bump than from a flat spot. The player turns those bounces into ones and zeros, and that becomes your movie.",
     "do": [{"zoom": "disc"}, {"highlight": ["disc"]}]},
    {"say": "A little gear and motor slide the laser along, from the middle of the disc to the edge, like a record player's arm.",
